"The definitions of B<MS_DIRSYNC>, B<MS_MOVE>, B<MS_PRIVATE>, B<MS_REC>, "
"B<MS_RELATIME>, B<MS_SHARED>, B<MS_SLAVE>, B<MS_STRICTATIME>, and "
